      "principle": "The marriage between two Hindus is governed by the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955.",
      "held": "The marriage between two hindus is governed by Hindu Marriage Act,1955. Section 7 of the Hindu Marriage Act, states unequivocally that where between the parties, the practice of saptapadi is followed, the marriage is complete upon the 7 th step being taken.",
